# 统一 LF 行尾：避免 windows runner 上 git autocrlf 把文件转成 CRLF，
# 导致 dotnet format（.editorconfig end_of_line = lf）误报 ENDOFLINE。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.cs text eol=lf
*.csproj text eol=lf
*.props text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.sln text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
*.zip binary
